    "VghLantern__LanternEditor__Warnings__Config": {
        "VghLantern__LanternEditor__Warnings__Config__Description": "Declarative rule table for the editor WarningSystem. Each rule names a metric the WarningSystem knows how to measure, a comparison operator, and a limit that is either literal or read from VghLantern__Validation__Config. Adding a manufacturing rule is a JSON edit; the module never hardcodes a threshold.",

